<title>FRANCE: FEATURE - Ad execs find local culture key to global success.</title>
<headline>FEATURE - Ad execs find local culture key to global success.</headline>
<byline>Leslie Adler</byline>
<dateline>CANNES, France 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Companies trying to sell their products in many countries are making increasing efforts with their advertising agencies to reach consumers by tapping into the local culture.</p>
<p>Industry experts say understanding local tastes and cultures</p>
</text>
